DAT
id=qid::label=str::text=lstr::
2644::$$$message_0017_0000_0000$$$::It isn't lunch yet, but something smells good.[lr]::
2645::$$$message_0017_0000_0001$$$::...Hmm, who is cooking what?[lr]::
2646::$$$message_0017_0000_0002$$$::"This aroma..."[lr]::
2647::$$$message_0017_0000_0003$$$::Someone's baking a cake or a pie.[lr]::
2648::$$$message_0017_0000_0004$$$::The only person who's good at baking in this house is Sakura.::
2649::$$$message_0017_0001_0000$$$::"And..."[lr]::
2650::$$$message_0017_0001_0001$$$::I look in the living room and the kitchen, but nobody's there.[lr]::
2651::$$$message_0017_0001_0002$$$::Is the smell coming from Sakura's room, then...?::
2652::$$$message_0017_0002_0000$$$::"Sakura, you in there?"[lr]::
2653::$$$message_0017_0002_0001$$$::"Ah, Senpai. Please come in."[lr]::
2654::$$$message_0017_0002_0002$$$::"...Is that Shirou?"[lr]::
2655::$$$message_0017_0002_0003$$$::Oh, is Saber inside Sakura's room, too?::
2656::$$$message_0017_0003_0000$$$::"Pardon me... Ah, I figured."[lr]::
2657::$$$message_0017_0003_0001$$$::I nod once I enter Sakura's room.[lr]::
2658::$$$message_0017_0003_0002$$$::It smells good.[lr]::
2659::$$$message_0017_0003_0003$$$::There's a freshly baked pie on the desk, and a fork.[lr]::
2660::$$$message_0017_0003_0004$$$::The fragrance of the butter and crust play a delectable duo in the air, whetting my appetite before lunchtime.::
2661::$$$message_0017_0004_0000$$$::"Shirou... We didn't mean to keep this from you, but Sakura invited me, and I..."[lr]::
2662::$$$message_0017_0004_0001$$$::Saber makes an excuse, looking guilty for munching away at the pie.[lr]::
2663::$$$message_0017_0004_0002$$$::I can see that she's been eating.::
2664::$$$message_0017_0005_0000$$$::"It's all right, Saber. Keep eating.[lr]::
2665::$$$message_0017_0005_0001$$$::Did you bake that pie, Sakura?"[lr]::
2666::$$$message_0017_0005_0002$$$::"Yes. While persimmons are good in the fall, I like chestnuts, too."[lr]::
2667::$$$message_0017_0005_0003$$$::"Same. Like when they're steamed in rice... So that's chestnut pie?"::
2668::$$$message_0017_0006_0000$$$::It's a small pie just big enough for one person, topped with chestnuts.[lr]::
2669::$$$message_0017_0006_0001$$$::While big pies are nice too, there's an appeal to personal pies like these.::
2670::$$$message_0017_0007_0000$$$::"Yes, I put a little effort into it and made the dough from scratch."[lr]::
2671::$$$message_0017_0007_0001$$$::"Um... Sakura looked like she was really struggling, so I lent her a hand."[lr]::
2672::$$$message_0017_0007_0002$$$::Saber helped with baking? How unusual.::
2673::$$$message_0017_0008_0000$$$::"That's right. Puff pastry dough is more delicious, though it took a lot of work."[lr]::
2674::$$$message_0017_0008_0001$$$::"Even I can manage folding dough repeatedly."[lr]::
2675::$$$message_0017_0008_0002$$$::It's true that it takes a lot of physical labor to fold pie dough. That's why premade dough exists.::
2676::$$$message_0017_0009_0000$$$::"It was a very interesting process, Shirou."[lr]::
2677::$$$message_0017_0009_0001$$$::"And now my assistant Saber is helping me taste test the finished product."[lr]::
2678::$$$message_0017_0009_0002$$$::Ah, so that's why Saber's eating in Sakura's room.[lr]::
2679::$$$message_0017_0009_0003$$$::[chgfg time=300 storage=桜私服07c(中),セイバー私服07c(中) textoff=0]It was taste testing, not snacking between meals.::
2680::$$$message_0017_0010_0000$$$::"So you made it together. How does it taste, Saber?"[lr]::
2681::$$$message_0017_0010_0001$$$::"The sweetness of the chestnuts and the texture of the dough form an exquisite combination. [cacheimage storage=セイバー私服01b(中)][wvl][chgfg time=300 storage=セイバー私服01b(中) textoff=0]Sakura, I sincerely admire your dessert-making skills."[lr]::
2682::$$$message_0017_0010_0002$$$::"Thank you, Saber. You're a master at dough-making, too."::
2683::$$$message_0017_0011_0000$$$::"Huh..."[lr]::
2684::$$$message_0017_0011_0001$$$::The air between them feels friendlier than ever.[lr]::
2685::$$$message_0017_0011_0002$$$::They already get along normally, but maybe this is the sweet mood of a private girls-only tea party.::
2686::$$$message_0017_0012_0000$$$::"Oh Saber, what were the cakes like in your country? Were they piled high with exotic fruits?"[lr]::
2687::$$$message_0017_0012_0001$$$::"Agh... Unfortunately, there wasn't any sugar in my era. I don't believe sweet treats such as this had been developed yet."::
2688::$$$message_0017_0013_0000$$$::"Oh... I see."[lr]::
2689::$$$message_0017_0013_0001$$$::"Our cooks did strut their skills during banquets, but...[cacheimage storage=セイバー私服12d(中)][wvl][chgfg time=300 storage=セイバー私服12d(中) textoff=0]..."::
2690::$$$message_0017_0014_0000$$$::Saber doesn't seem very interested when it comes to talking about her country's cuisine.[lr]::
2691::$$$message_0017_0014_0001$$$::But afternoon tea was invented in England. Culinary reputation aside, shouldn't they at least have simple and delicious teatime treats?::
2692::$$$message_0017_0015_0000$$$::"In that case...was the style more like the cakes that Mitsuzuri-senpai [cacheimage storage=セイバー私服04e(中)][wvl][chgfg time=300 storage=セイバー私服04e(中) textoff=0]bakes?"[lr]::
2693::$$$message_0017_0015_0001$$$::"What? Wait, Sakura, Mitsuzuri bakes cakes?"::
2694::$$$message_0017_0016_0000$$$::"Yes. She's brought them over to the club several times. She's good at making stuff that has baking powder."[lr]::
2695::$$$message_0017_0016_0001$$$::"So American... Yeah, she's oddly good at making large batches."[lr]::
2696::$$$message_0017_0016_0002$$$::Mitsuzuri's motto is: the bigger the quantity, the better the flavor.[lr]::
2697::$$$message_0017_0016_0003$$$::I'd like to ask her to make okonomiyaki sometime.::
2698::$$$message_0017_0017_0000$$$::"Cakes from the New World... This approach of quantity over quality seems familiar."[lr]::
2699::$$$message_0017_0017_0001$$$::Saber sets her fork down.[lr]::
2700::$$$message_0017_0017_0002$$$::She finished the chestnut pie quickly.::
2701::$$$message_0017_0018_0000$$$::"That was very well done. You could even give Fleur's desserts a run for their money."[lr]::
2702::$$$message_0017_0018_0001$$$::"Ooh."[lr]::
2703::$$$message_0017_0018_0002$$$::Saber often has a lot to say about flavor, but if this has her endorsement, then it's safe to say the chestnut pie was a smashing success.[lr]::
2704::$$$message_0017_0018_0003$$$::Which leaves...::
2705::$$$message_0017_0019_0000$$$::"Hey, Sakura. Do you still have any more of that chestnut pie?"[lr]::
2706::$$$message_0017_0019_0001$$$::"Yes. I made enough for everyone, so I was planning to serve them for dessert after lunch."::
2707::$$$message_0017_0020_0000$$$::"Good. That settles the dessert part of the menu.[lr]::
2708::$$$message_0017_0020_0001$$$::Now I need to think of a meal that pairs with the pie. Pie wouldn't really be good to have right after udon, for example."[lr]::
2709::$$$message_0017_0020_0002$$$::"I can eat anything after noodles, though."[lr]::
2710::$$$message_0017_0020_0003$$$::"Then how about pasta? We still have some canned anchovies and olives, as well as vegetables."::
2711::$$$message_0017_0021_0000$$$::"Okay. Then let's make it a light lunch.[lr]::
2712::$$$message_0017_0021_0001$$$::If everyone is full, they won't be able to taste the fruit of your labor."[lr]::
2713::$$$message_0017_0021_0002$$$::"It's all right, Senpai! We always have room for dessert!"::
2714::$$$message_0017_0022_0000$$$::Saber nods vigorously.[lr]::
2715::$$$message_0017_0022_0001$$$::...How overwhelmingly persuasive. The women in my house sure are dependable at times like this.::
2716::$$$message_0017_0023_0000$$$::"Okay, settle down.[lr]::
2717::$$$message_0017_0023_0001$$$::You two made the pies, so I'll make lunch on my own. Take it easy until then."::
2718::$$$message_0017_0024_0000$$$::"Yes, we'll take you up on that."[lr]::
2719::$$$message_0017_0024_0001$$$::They answer in harmony.[lr]::
2720::$$$message_0017_0024_0002$$$::I smile and nod, then leave Sakura's room.[lr]::
2721::$$$message_0017_0024_0003$$$::Now...[lr]::
2722::$$$message_0017_0024_0004$$$::I'll make a spicy pasta that's no less tasty than that chestnut pie.::

